Print #1,Errn : Error 25
Print #1,Errn;Err$(25);"|";Err$(1);"|";Len(Err$(0));Len(Err$(500))
Print #1,Str$(0);Str$(-2147483648);Str$(2147483647);Str$(7)
Fix 2 : Print #1,3.14159;1/3 : Fix -3 : Print #1,1234.5 : Fix 16 : Print #1,0.5 : Fix -1
Degree : Print #1,Int(Sin(90)*1000) : Radian : Print #1,Int(Sin(Pi#/2)*1000)
Randomize 1234 : R=Rnd(-1000) : Randomize 1234 : Print #1,R=Rnd(-1000);Rnd(0)=R
OK=-1 : For I=1 To 200 : R=Rnd(17) : If R<0 or R>17 Then OK=0
Next I : Print #1,OK
Print #1,Rnd(-1)>=0;Rnd(0)>=0
Timer=100 : Print #1,Timer>=100 : Wait 5 : Print #1,Timer>=105
Wait Vbl : Multi Wait : Print #1,"waited"
Wait -1
Put Key "x" : Wait Key : Print #1,Inkey$;"|"
Key Speed 10,2
Key Speed -1,2
P : Print #1,Param;Param$
Areg(0)=1234 : Dreg(7)=-5 : Print #1,Areg(0);Dreg(7)
Areg(7)=1
Print #1,Dreg(8)
Reserve As Work 10,100 : A=Start(10)
Doke A+1,$1234 : Loke A+5,$11223344 : Print #1,Peek(A+1);Peek(A+2);Hex$(Deek(A+1));Hex$(Leek(A+5));Hex$(Leek(A+4))
Poke$ A+20,"Hello" : Print #1,Peek$(A+20,5);"|";Peek$(A+20,100,"l");"|";Peek$(A+20,3,"");"|";Peek$(A+20,0)
Fill A To A+19,$01020304 : Print #1,Peek(A+16);Peek(A+17);Peek(A+18);Peek(A+19);Peek(A+20)
Fill 10 To A+3,$AABBCCDD : Print #1,Hex$(Leek(A))
Fill A+10 To A,0
Copy A+20,A+25 To A+22 : Print #1,Peek$(A+20,7)
Copy A+22,A+27 To A+21 : Print #1,Peek$(A+20,7)
Copy A,A To A+50
Print #1,Hunt(10 To A+99,"llo")-A;Hunt(A To A+99,"zz");Hunt(A To A+99,"")
Procedure P
End Proc[42,"ret"]
